s-form (or \u201cthe nuclear option\u201d as they nicknamed it during the playtest) but they avoided using it until late in the story.</li> <li>Mature Content Warning/pg13, forms of playing and playing aids get discussed.</li> <li>Lexicon: Instead of Humanity you have Harano and Hauglosk trackers. Rage-Dice function like Desperation-Dice in Hunter but with different flavor.</li> <li>Fianna are now called Hart Wardens.</li> <li>There\u2019s a google-doc with a poll about which Tribe should get previewed first.</li> <li>Q&amp;A-section:</li> <li>The W5 physical book is on different paper than the V5 corebook, not as white, not glossy.</li> <li>Final corrected version of V5 Players Guide will get released soon as well.</li> <li>Crinos as a form is tied to Rage (previews will cover that later).</li> <li>Next preview in two weeks.</li> </ul></div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for doing that so we didn't have to. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Ok, so pretty much nothing more than whats on the pages.....and they still can't decide whether the Apocalypse has happened or not and or if Gaia is dead or not......I have a feeling different freelancers had different interpretations of the vagaries....so that will be interesting.<br /> <br /> Apparently one of the contributors for The Savage Age worked on it, but I didn't see them in the list of freelancers Justin released.<br /> <br /> Chris Chung is a fairly well known board game designer, could it be him?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26564-badfurryfanfic","name":"BadFurryFanFic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"93"}]},"than